{"753bc8b4-039e-4058-bcab-978e3be362e9":{"id":"753bc8b4-039e-4058-bcab-978e3be362e9","title":"I Became a Childhood Friend of a Mid-Level Boss","altTitle":"I Became the Childhood Friend of the Middle Boss","description":"Do Kyunwoo is the black sheep of his renowned swordsman family. He cannot even catch a rabbit on his own. On his first day of fifth grade, he meets a tranfer student and recalls his past life.\n\nHe had reincarnated into the world of a game he used to play called [Brave Hearts]. He was already frustrated that he had reincarnated as a loser, but on top of that, the transfer student is an intermediate/mid-tier boss who will destroy the world!\n\n“Why are you being so nice to me?”\n\n“Because I want to be friends with you.”\n\nDo Kyunwoo’s plan is to become friends with the transfer student in order to prevent the end of the world!\n\nIn order to survive in this new world and to reach an ending he desires. He becomes best friends with the mid level boss.","year":2024,"status":"completed","lastChapter":"39","contentRating":"safe","tags":["Action","Adventure","Isekai","Fantasy"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/753bc8b4-039e-4058-bcab-978e3be362e9/a381035f-29f8-40de-9d28-d1595130a9ce.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ko","availableLanguages":["pt-br","en"],"lane":"manhwa","rating":7.39,"follows":26469,"listAt":"2026-10-19T10:05:23.768Z","chapters":[{"id":"ec448f8e-74a3-4066-bf45-2d8e616dfcc2","number":"39","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":71,"createdAt":"2024-10-03T12:10:38+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"7140bf54-0f8a-40c5-ae00-9b0741577e6f","number":"38","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":58,"createdAt":"2024-10-03T12:07:28+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"bb9d5f9d-2bb9-4c18-98bc-1f18dc813711","number":"37","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":68,"createdAt":"2024-09-27T14:45:00+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"c2d5c183-a7fb-4ded-b5bd-66f1435caa7d","number":"36","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":63,"crea