:06:46.938Z"},"ef44c099-6e5c-4e6a-b7e3-68d99b98099a":{"id":"ef44c099-6e5c-4e6a-b7e3-68d99b98099a","title":"Henkyou Kishidan no Oryourigakari! ~Suterare Youjo Desu ga, Kahogo na Kazoku ni Hirowarete Oishii Gohan wo Tsukurimasu~","altTitle":"The Frontier Knight Order's Cook!: I'm an Abandoned Little Girl, but I was Picked Up by an Overprotective Family and Now I Make Delicious Meals","description":"Elle yang berusia lima tahun dituduh dikutuk dan dianiaya oleh keluarganya.\n\nAkhirnya, dia ditinggalkan di hutan dan saat mengembara, ia ditemukan oleh tiga bersaudara dari ordo ksatria, yang dipimpin oleh keluarga Margrave...! \n\nElle takut akan ditinggalkan lagi, tetapi keluarga Margrave secara tak terduga menyambutnya dengan berkata, \n\n\"Apakah kamu ingin menjadi anak kami?\"\n\nElle dicintai oleh semua ksatria dan menjalani kehidupan yang penuh kebahagiaan... atau begitulah kelihatannya... \n\ntetapi kemudian, kenangan kehidupan sebelumnya menjalankan restoran kecil kembali padanya, dan dia menyadari satu masalah besar...! \n\n\"Makanan di negeri ini sama sekali tidak enak...!\" \n\nUntuk membuat makanan lezat di negeri terpencil ini, Elle memutuskan untuk menjadi juru masak para ksatria...!","year":2025,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Comedy","Isekai","Drama","Fantasy"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/ef44c099-6e5c-4e6a-b7e3-68d99b98099a/857f339e-71a3-4feb-8c68-bc08d4bdc78d.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ja","availableLanguages":["id","en"],"lane":"manga","rating":8.17,"follows":1063,"listAt":"2026-10-24T07:00:24.748Z","chapters":[{"id":"ffb904c6-ef2a-42b6-b769-29afe5dcb6df","number":"2","volume":"1","title":null,"lang":"id","pages":25,"createdAt":"2026-10-18T10:42:03+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"708f2178-07c6-4815-a5b1-b3acc9b251c2","number":"1","volume":"1","title":null,"lang":"id","pages":29,"createdAt":"2026-01-05T13:23:42+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"753ccf1b-45b4-4895-87e9-3c53d2e52cbd","number":"1","volume":"1","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":28,"createdAt":"2026-05-23T13:24:33+00:00","baked":false}],"chapterCount":3,"chaptersAt":"2026-10-26T19:09:41.489Z"},"af1f3853-6b99-44a2-b01d-28e9ce9a1e05":{"id":"af1f3853-6b99-44a2-b01d-28e9ce9a1e05","title":"Watashi no Kokoro wa Ojisan de Aru","altTitle":"My Heart Is an Ojisan","description":"With no friends, family, or romance to speak of, Haruka has lived his life just going through the motions—until the day he awakens in the body of a beautiful, and womanly, dark elf! Suddenly, a world beyond his wildest imagination awaits, and uncontainable excitement races through him. There's just one problem: He gave up on putting himself out there a long time ago and has no idea how to strike up a conversation with other people. Teenagers and (other) women are certainly no exception. But with a bottomless well of mana and a ridiculously tough body to boot, Haruka won't let any overthinking get in the way this time. Little by little, the dark elf works past his (her) fears and self-doubt, forging deep bonds with precious new friends and growing together with them.","year":2024,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Action","Adventure","Isekai","Fantasy"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/af1f3853-6b99-44a2-b01d-28e9ce9a1e05/ff57a327-65f2-4dcf-bc10-557a807926ab.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ja","availableLanguages":["es-la","en","id","pt-br","vi"],"lane":"manga","rating":8.85,"follows":34152,"listAt":"2026-10-29T13:11:15.199Z","chapters":[{"id":"4ba42570-664a-4f4f-b191-6d1d4f2a2ada","number":"45","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":21,"createdAt":"2026-10-21T10:32:40+00:00","baked":true},{"id":"071af257-78b3-4f2b-a4f1-37c3af1871c2","number":"44","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":23,"createdAt":"2026-09-30T09:31:52+00:00","baked":true},{"id":"a3794f46-54f8-41ee-8859-7f997c914ba4","number":"43","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":21,"createdAt":"2026-09-04T